    "classification": "known-provider-errors-left-nonterminal-by-exception-branch",
    "evidence": "The final three distinct critic calls each produced one fsynced provider-call-failed event with exception_type RateLimitError and retry forbidden. The retained source log reports Attempt #1 for each. No second-send, SDK retry, SiRA retry, duplicate counter, lost response receipt, transport ambiguity, or shutdown race is evidenced.",
    "implementation_defect": "ProviderBudgetBoundary.invoke durably charged each reservation and incremented unreconciled_provider_attempts before send, but its exception branch only persisted that open state and re-raised. It did not classify known provider errors, release their reservations, or write a terminal accounting state.",
    "prior_label_correction": "The historical 308977-token and USD 2.7540625 values include three retained conservative reservations. They are reserved upper bounds, not observed reconciled lower bounds. The 30 response receipts establish the 58469-token and USD 0.2845925 observed lower bounds."
  },
